  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India Economic Empowerment Project for Women (SEWA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide IT-enabled microenterprise support services to poor and vulnerable women in rural India (specifically in Gujarat, Rajasthan, Bihar and some North-Eastern states, with Gujarat as the main focus) to help improve their livelihoods and reduce their vulnerability.</narrative>
  </description>
